<title>BELGIUM: EU says clears Rhone-Poulenc/Merck venture.</title>
<headline>EU says clears Rhone-Poulenc/Merck venture.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said in a statement on Thursday it had cleared Rhone-Poulenc's proposed Merial animal health joint venture with Merck &amp; Co.</p>
</text>
